    "from_text": "将所得等式（1）和（2）相加，就得：",
    "from_formula": "$2S_n=(a_1+a_n)+(a_2+a_{n-1})+(a_3+a_{n-2})+\\cdots↵+(a_{n-2}+a_3)+(a_{n-1}+a_2)+(a_n+a_1)$.",
    "formula_already_complete": true,
    "formula_repeated_or_rewritten": false,
    "to_ref": "p0098#1",
    "to_marker": "p cont",
    "to_text": "在等式右边，每两个数的和等于$a_1+a_n$."
  },
